WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
video file & English subtitles: Safex
fixed by fofiko1 and Rémi

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:09.801
After being told by Tom
that Sister Pony was ill,

00:00:09.951 --> 00:00:12.640
Candy rushed back to Pony's Home.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:19.679
But, this was only a lie to stop Candy from
going to the hospital in the mountain area.

00:00:21.655 --> 00:00:28.026
A long and life-risking journey

00:00:49.183 --> 00:00:50.876
Mina's barking?

00:00:51.026 --> 00:00:52.244
Tom is here!

00:00:52.394 --> 00:00:54.287
Let’s see!

00:00:55.122 --> 00:00:56.885
Where are my shoes?

00:00:57.357 --> 00:00:58.450
How?

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:01.149
The clothes hanging on the wall...

00:01:01.299 --> 00:01:03.252
And my luggage...

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:15.473
Kurin, Kurin! All my things are gone.
Do you know where they are?

00:01:17.344 --> 00:01:19.904
You must know something.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.874
Help me find them.

00:01:22.024 --> 00:01:24.941
I can't go out like this.

00:01:28.288 --> 00:01:33.252
Any normal person wouldn't go to the
railway construction site in Graytown.

00:01:33.402 --> 00:01:34.887
Will Candy die there?

00:01:35.037 --> 00:01:37.222
Perhaps.

00:01:37.372 --> 00:01:38.891
Let's stop Candy from going there!

00:01:39.041 --> 00:01:42.060
Yes, let’s stop her!

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:46.401
Brother! Brother!

00:01:47.641 --> 00:01:49.871
Where have you been, John?

00:01:50.410 --> 00:01:53.405
Even if Candy wants to go,
she can't.

00:01:53.555 --> 00:01:55.774
How come, John?

00:01:55.924 --> 00:01:57.714
Candy...

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:03.149
She is wearing Sister Pony's shoes...

00:02:04.458 --> 00:02:05.517
Tom!

00:02:05.667 --> 00:02:07.352
Good morning, Candy.

00:02:07.502 --> 00:02:09.288
Not good morning.

00:02:09.438 --> 00:02:12.291
How could you be a thief?

00:02:12.441 --> 00:02:13.992
A thief?

00:02:14.142 --> 00:02:15.859
Yes!

00:02:16.009 --> 00:02:18.664
Look at me!

00:02:18.814 --> 00:02:21.199
What did I do?

00:02:21.349 --> 00:02:22.968
Your things...

00:02:23.118 --> 00:02:24.102
I hid them.

00:02:24.252 --> 00:02:25.003
John...

00:02:25.153 --> 00:02:27.806
I won't tell you where I hid them.

00:02:27.956 --> 00:02:32.958
I can't let Candy go to Graytown.
It's too dangerous there.

00:02:33.128 --> 00:02:36.580
Candy, don't go there!

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:40.552
I am very touched
because you are worried about me.

00:02:40.702 --> 00:02:42.154
But, I am a nurse.

00:02:42.304 --> 00:02:45.221
You can be a nurse anywhere.

00:02:45.399 --> 00:02:48.393
Be a nurse at Pony's Home!

00:02:48.543 --> 00:02:49.728
Please!

00:02:49.878 --> 00:02:54.466
Bob, you haven't said anything.
Do you want me to go?

00:02:54.616 --> 00:02:56.101
Bob, why do you agree?

00:02:56.251 --> 00:02:58.644
Do you hate Candy?

00:03:02.149 --> 00:03:03.742
A scar caused by a surgery?

00:03:04.092 --> 00:03:08.046
My father had taken me with him
to the railway works.

00:03:08.196 --> 00:03:10.916
I got ill there.

00:03:11.066 --> 00:03:14.152
The doctors there, if it weren't
for them, I would have died.

00:03:14.302 --> 00:03:16.955
How old were you, Bob?

00:03:17.105 --> 00:03:22.525
Three. I don't remember anyone
apart from the nurse.

00:03:25.205 --> 00:03:29.869
I will never forget her face.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.074
Is that why you agree with me?

00:03:36.324 --> 00:03:37.376
Yes.

00:03:37.526 --> 00:03:40.979
Bob is new here.
He's not worried about Candy.

00:03:41.129 --> 00:03:42.381
Yes! Yes!

00:03:42.531 --> 00:03:43.882
Say that again!

00:03:44.032 --> 00:03:45.751
I can say it several times!

00:03:45.901 --> 00:03:46.685
What?

00:03:46.835 --> 00:03:49.888
Stop! Both of you, stop!

00:03:50.297 --> 00:03:52.291
Sister Pony...

00:03:52.441 --> 00:03:57.863
Sister Pony, you must be against Candy
going to that kind of place?

00:03:58.013 --> 00:04:00.498
Yes, I am against it.

00:04:01.208 --> 00:04:03.268
That's right!

00:04:03.418 --> 00:04:04.803
Sister Pony...

00:04:04.953 --> 00:04:07.606
If Candy was not a nurse,
I certainly would!

00:04:07.756 --> 00:04:09.474
Sister Pony, do you mean...

00:04:09.624 --> 00:04:16.328
The workers at the construction
site in the mountains need Candy.

00:04:16.823 --> 00:04:18.350
What about Sister Lane?

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.087
Sister Lane agrees with me.

00:04:22.237 --> 00:04:25.529
Thank you, Sister Pony.

00:04:25.799 --> 00:04:28.560
John, Candy is a lady now.

00:04:28.710 --> 00:04:32.164
She can't go out in a nightdress.

00:04:32.314 --> 00:04:34.207
Do you understand, John?

00:04:34.975 --> 00:04:37.535
Where did you hide them?

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:40.242
On The Father Tree.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:53.691
We haven't been here for a while, Kurin.

00:04:54.728 --> 00:04:57.891
One, two, three.

00:05:04.938 --> 00:05:08.897
Nothing has changed here!

00:05:28.661 --> 00:05:34.229
I will be back soon, Sister Pony,
Sister Lane, Bob, children...

00:05:34.868 --> 00:05:38.895
What did they give me?

00:05:48.281 --> 00:05:51.614
It's so heavy!
There must be many gifts inside.

00:05:58.624 --> 00:06:00.285
Kurin...

00:06:01.194 --> 00:06:03.087
Is anything wrong, miss?

00:06:03.237 --> 00:06:07.599
Nothing, nothing at all.

00:06:33.192 --> 00:06:35.386
Let me help you.

00:06:35.536 --> 00:06:38.055
Thanks, but I am going to the last station.

00:06:38.205 --> 00:06:43.861
You have to go to the first carriage.
This carriage stops here.

00:06:44.011 --> 00:06:48.499
I see.
Let's go, Kurin!

00:06:48.649 --> 00:06:50.300
How do you know?

00:06:50.450 --> 00:06:56.373
That's my name!
Everybody calls me Kurin!

00:06:56.523 --> 00:06:57.608
Mr. Kurin?

00:06:57.758 --> 00:07:04.452
My real name is Kurinton.
But they call me Kurin.

00:07:06.292 --> 00:07:07.884
Sorry!

00:07:29.448 --> 00:07:31.916
You can come out, Kurin.

00:07:34.620 --> 00:07:37.680
All of a sudden, I feel so lonely.

00:07:47.099 --> 00:07:51.461
What? It's only a newspaper...
Any news?

00:07:51.611 --> 00:07:58.502
Wanted criminals...

00:07:58.652 --> 00:08:01.071
It's important to recognize
the persons in the pictures.

00:08:01.221 --> 00:08:05.242
What if we meet one of them?

00:08:08.787 --> 00:08:11.051
I think we're fine.

00:08:51.930 --> 00:08:53.921
It's morning.

00:08:58.704 --> 00:09:01.104
It's hard for you, Kurin, I know.

00:09:02.908 --> 00:09:08.813
There is nobody here. You can come out
and walk around for a while.

00:09:13.752 --> 00:09:16.915
I will do some exercise.

00:09:21.526 --> 00:09:23.289
What's wrong, Kurin?

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:26.955
Is anybody here?

00:09:43.248 --> 00:09:45.148
I am sorry!

00:09:48.854 --> 00:09:51.315
Kurin, please hide for a while.

00:09:51.465 --> 00:09:56.191
We finally got here. We'd better
not let the conductor find out.

00:09:58.463 --> 00:10:07.998
His face looks so familiar...
Traits: light skin, woman's voice.

00:10:08.148 --> 00:10:09.836
They all match!

00:10:11.109 --> 00:10:13.441
I must tell the conductor!

00:10:19.985 --> 00:10:27.118
There is no conductor? I don't want
to be alone with a wanted man!

00:11:06.764 --> 00:11:10.598
Where are you taking me to?

00:11:11.068 --> 00:11:12.633
To Hell.

00:11:18.976 --> 00:11:22.604
That's too bad. I am shaking.

00:11:27.618 --> 00:11:29.347
No fever.

00:11:29.787 --> 00:11:31.778
Thank you.

00:11:36.226 --> 00:11:37.953
My heart almost stopped.

00:11:38.103 --> 00:11:40.022
I can't breathe.

00:11:40.172 --> 00:11:42.156
Hurry to the station!

00:11:59.583 --> 00:12:04.850
Why is it so slow?
Hurry up to the station!

00:12:41.792 --> 00:12:46.957
Why is the station-master not here?
That face...

00:12:48.232 --> 00:12:52.828
No doubt, it's him.
There should be somebody over there.

00:12:54.038 --> 00:12:56.700
Anybody here? Good afternoon.

00:12:57.141 --> 00:13:02.717
My watch stopped again.
You are not a girl, are you?

00:13:03.267 --> 00:13:05.608
Of course I am!

00:13:05.758 --> 00:13:07.242
Unbelievable!

00:13:07.392 --> 00:13:13.349
It is the first time a girl comes here.
Even the watch got scared!

00:13:13.499 --> 00:13:16.352
There is a murderer on the train.

00:13:16.502 --> 00:13:17.853
A murderer?

00:13:18.003 --> 00:13:20.856
Yes, there is a warning
in the newspaper.

00:13:21.006 --> 00:13:24.793
To me, you are more of a problem
than that murderer.

00:13:24.943 --> 00:13:28.531
How can you be so calm?
You should call the police!

00:13:32.108 --> 00:13:37.172
There's no police in the mountains.
Right! Who are you here for?

00:13:37.322 --> 00:13:40.475
I am a nurse.
I came here to work.

00:13:40.625 --> 00:13:42.211
What?

00:13:44.521 --> 00:13:46.521
Look!

00:13:47.423 --> 00:13:52.921
Miss, if you are afraid of this,
how will you work here?

00:13:53.071 --> 00:13:54.554
But...

00:13:54.731 --> 00:13:57.625
I mean, it's better for you
to go back to the city.

00:13:57.775 --> 00:14:00.295
Please let me see the doctor first.

00:14:00.445 --> 00:14:01.329
The doctor?

00:14:01.479 --> 00:14:03.164
Yes, the doctor, at the clinic.

00:14:03.314 --> 00:14:05.967
He ran away one month ago.

00:14:06.117 --> 00:14:08.442
There is no doctor here?

00:14:08.945 --> 00:14:11.272
Excuse me,
where is the construction site?

00:14:11.422 --> 00:14:14.441
It takes four and a half hours
by train.

00:14:14.684 --> 00:14:19.747
Please write down your name and address
I can inform your family if you die.

00:14:19.897 --> 00:14:22.848
There are often falling rocks
on the way.

00:14:23.793 --> 00:14:24.586
Excuse me...

00:14:24.736 --> 00:14:28.324
Go back.
There will be a train in two hours.

00:14:29.198 --> 00:14:31.029
Follow me.

00:14:33.603 --> 00:14:35.332
Wait!

00:14:40.877 --> 00:14:43.539
Pick a carriage you like.

00:14:49.419 --> 00:14:50.111
I...

00:14:50.261 --> 00:14:52.854
Go back, miss.

00:15:02.665 --> 00:15:04.292
I am going too!

00:15:06.169 --> 00:15:08.069
Here, grab my hand!

00:15:27.323 --> 00:15:30.815
Don't worry, Kurin.

00:15:37.867 --> 00:15:41.563
He likes Kurin.
He can't be a bad person.

00:15:41.713 --> 00:15:47.167
You two, pray to God
we don't end up like that!

00:15:55.385 --> 00:15:57.182
Sister Pony!

00:16:00.923 --> 00:16:02.216
Down!

00:16:02.366 --> 00:16:03.815
This place is so dangerous!

00:16:15.972 --> 00:16:21.137
There is one carriage missing only.
God must have heard your prayers!

00:16:40.863 --> 00:16:44.230
Praying won't be enough!

00:17:02.151 --> 00:17:06.520
It's an explosion, run for your life!
Follow me!

00:17:14.597 --> 00:17:16.121
This place is dangerous!

00:17:29.946 --> 00:17:34.575
It's too dangerous...

00:17:35.525 --> 00:17:37.247
You bastard!

00:17:41.924 --> 00:17:43.217
Boss...

00:17:43.367 --> 00:17:46.853
We have told you
the time of the explosions.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:51.160
Sorry, my watch stopped.

00:17:51.310 --> 00:17:56.530
I don't mind if people die,
but this is the last wagon we have!

00:17:58.473 --> 00:18:01.902
Aren't people's lives more important
than the wagon?

00:18:02.052 --> 00:18:05.372
Shut up, you don't know anything.
And who are you?

00:18:05.522 --> 00:18:08.442
She is the nurse of the clinic.

00:18:08.592 --> 00:18:10.811
What? A nurse?

00:18:10.961 --> 00:18:15.048
We need a doctor, not a nurse.
You are useless!

00:18:15.198 --> 00:18:16.049
That's rude.

00:18:16.199 --> 00:18:20.888
A wagon is more important
than people's lives, I can't stand this!

00:18:21.038 --> 00:18:23.824
You are annoying.
This is not a city hospital!

00:18:23.974 --> 00:18:27.243
Station-master,
get her out of here, please!

00:18:27.793 --> 00:18:29.195
Boss!

00:18:29.345 --> 00:18:30.635
It's bad.

00:18:30.805 --> 00:18:32.165
Boss, it's really bad.

00:18:32.315 --> 00:18:34.034
What happened?

00:18:34.184 --> 00:18:37.904
- Boss, in the explosion, Ben...
- Got hurt ?

00:18:38.054 --> 00:18:39.572
Yes.

00:18:39.722 --> 00:18:41.708
He is losing a lot of blood
and he has a high fever.

00:18:41.858 --> 00:18:47.312
Idiot!
Miss, let me see how good you are.

00:18:48.023 --> 00:18:51.225
My name is Candice White!
You can call me Candy!

00:19:12.847 --> 00:19:14.314
This is bad!

00:19:14.849 --> 00:19:16.942
How is it, miss nurse?

00:19:17.185 --> 00:19:18.978
He needs surgery right away.

00:19:19.128 --> 00:19:20.580
Then go ahead!

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:22.114
Me?

00:19:22.264 --> 00:19:23.683
You don't know how to?

00:19:23.833 --> 00:19:26.886
I can only wrap the wounds for him.

00:19:27.562 --> 00:19:28.893
Go away.

00:19:30.631 --> 00:19:32.599
What are you doing?

00:19:33.067 --> 00:19:36.262
We can wrap wounds too!

00:19:36.412 --> 00:19:38.965
Station-master, take her back.

00:19:40.675 --> 00:19:44.604
But, his life will be in danger
if you don't wrap his wounds!

00:19:44.754 --> 00:19:47.614
Don't argue with the boss.

00:19:48.649 --> 00:19:52.345
No, I am a nurse.

00:19:52.495 --> 00:19:55.617
Get this girl out of here!

00:19:57.024 --> 00:19:58.217
Come, miss.

00:19:58.367 --> 00:20:01.227
Stop! Stop! Kurin!

00:20:04.332 --> 00:20:06.675
It hurts!

00:20:06.825 --> 00:20:08.060
What's that?

00:20:08.210 --> 00:20:11.127
Take the patient to the clinic.

00:20:13.541 --> 00:20:15.236
You are...

00:20:16.143 --> 00:20:17.670
I will do the surgery.

00:20:17.820 --> 00:20:19.542
Who are you?

00:20:20.748 --> 00:20:23.911
I am the new doctor, Dr. Kerry.

00:20:28.389 --> 00:20:30.583
I see, the new doctor.

00:20:30.733 --> 00:20:32.148
Hurry up!

00:20:32.527 --> 00:20:37.464
Yes. Everyone, move it back!

00:20:48.309 --> 00:20:50.038
It's ready.

00:20:55.683 --> 00:20:59.744
It's going to take many hours.
Hang in there Candy!

00:21:01.556 --> 00:21:04.081
Dr. Kerry?

00:21:06.561 --> 00:21:12.329
She thought this was a murderer
but she's the new doctor.

00:21:13.134 --> 00:21:19.073
It wasn't a man, but a woman.

00:21:19.607 --> 00:21:24.840
More surprises and accidents
await Candy.
